Allows you to dual wield any type of one handed weapons, and increases the damage of the off-hand weapon to [57%, 65%, 70%, 73%, 76% (TL1-5)].

Also, casting a spell (which uses a turn) will give a free melee attack at a random target in melee range for [42%, 51%, 58%, 64%, 70% (TL1-5)] blight damage.
